/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (GCNI facilitated policy dialogues with key public institutions including the Health System Evaluation Report, developed in 2024 with inputs from 13 senior stakeholders, assessed improvements in transparency, compliance, and stakeholder behaviour. Additional advocacy events, such as World Health Day dialogues and International Anti-Corruption Day symposia, strengthened engagement with government and regulatory bodies.)
/E (GCNI facilitated policy dialogues with key public institutions including the Health System Evaluation Report, developed in 2024 with inputs from 13 senior stakeholders, assessed improvements in transparency, compliance, and stakeholder behaviour. Additional advocacy events, such as World Health Day dialogues and International Anti-Corruption Day symposia, strengthened engagement with government and regulatory bodies.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
