/E (During project implantation phase between June 2020 and September 2021, GCNI aimed at engaging relevant stakeholders in understanding ACCA, sharing sector-specific challenges, and building momentum toward collaborative ownership. GCNI strategically used ideation meetings, public webinars, and stakeholder mapping to generate awareness and support for the collective action approach.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
>>
