/S /P
/E (Two major ideation meetings were held on November 25 and 30, 2020, convening 30 key stakeholders from the healthcare, pharmaceutical, civil society, business, and public sectors. These sessions helped validate the healthcare sector as the collective focus and encouraged active participation in shaping the initiative to address corruption challenges in Healthcare in India.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
