<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Feedback from members indicates that the initiative not only improved the understanding of corruption risks but also encouraged real organizational shifts in values and operations. Participants consistently reported enhanced internal practices, greater alignment with ethical standards, and growing interest in integrating collective action principles into their institutional frameworks.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
