/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This Playbook developed by UNGC on Anti-Corruption Collective Action offers practical guidance for businesses, civil society, and public sector actors to collaboratively address corruption. Drawing on real-world experiences, it outlines flexible strategies for initiating, implementing, and sustaining collective action initiatives. The Playbook serves as a step-by-step roadmap, detailing stakeholder roles, governance structures, and tools to build trust and drive long-term impact. Document Link)
